 $('#help').onclick=()=>openModal('<p class="eyebrow">DUEL DOCTRINE LAB · 2.2.0-rc</p><h2>Watch. Pause. Understand.</h2><p>Choose your matchup and AI Watch, Deal a Hand, Play vs AI or Replay a Seed. Learning pace gives every resolving link four seconds, with extra time for longer text. Chains build quickly, then resolve from the top down. Tap to continue is optional. Skip FX skips only the current scene.</p><p>Open the gear for pace, five sound buses, spoken callouts, reduced motion and the coach. The coach explains each real decision. In the journal, tap a moment to rewind to that decision; bookmarks are saved on this device. Rewind pauses the duel so you can inspect it before resuming.</p><p>Long-press a field card to read its text; swipe up on your hand to spread it. Portrait offers an overview; landscape is recommended. Use your browser’s Install / Add to home screen for offline play after the offline download completes.</p><p>The Optimal pilot uses bounded engine-replayed search, resource preservation and a blunder guard. It cannot guarantee perfect play against hidden information. The native engine decides legality. Best-of-three siding is a later stage.</p>');
